BBC TAMS specification
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

OpenTAMS implements the Time-addressable Media Store (TAMS) API specification
published by the British Broadcasting Corporation at
https://github.com/bbc/tams, which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

The JSON Schema files under api/schemas/ are derived from that specification at
tag 8.0 (commit b386c43f97f05274d838066c62eb1d9dad351ea6). They are MODIFIED
copies, not an upstream mirror: 17 of the 41 vendored files differ from
upstream, and one file has no upstream counterpart. Every modification is
catalogued in api/schemas/README.md.

OpenTAMS is an independent implementation. Its TAMS conformance is
self-assessed and documented, with its known gaps, in docs/conformance.md.

Amagi thanks the BBC for publishing TAMS as an open specification.

